OL,3,GNEWSAParents and teachers have their
OL,4,Asay on restricting phones in schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents and teachers are being asked
OL,7,Ffor their views on restricting mobile
OL,8,Fphones in schools, with Wales' largest
OL,9,Fteaching union calling for a national
OL,10,Fban.
OL,12,FNASUWT Cymru said its members in
OL,13,Fschools where phones are already banned
OL,14,Fhave found it "transformational" with
OL,15,Fimproved learner engagement and
OL,16,Fbehaviour. Parents and teachers are
OL,17,Fbeing asked for their views.
OL,19,FForcing schools to ban mobile phones
OL,20,Fhas been ruled out by the Welsh
OL,21,Fgovernment but it has promised to
OL,22,Fstrengthen national guidance.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
