OL,3,GNEWSAParents and teachers have their
OL,4,Asay on restricting phones in schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Minister for Education Anna Brychan
OL,7,FMS said there would be an expectation
OL,8,Fthat the use of mobile phones is
OL,9,Frestricted during the school day, but
OL,10,Fapproaches could vary across school
OL,11,Fsites.
